(linear probing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Uniform-hashing estimates) Tj T*
(Chaining: successful ~ 1 + alpha/2; unsuccessful ~ alpha.) Tj T*
(Linear: successful ~ 0.5*\(1 + 1/\(1-alpha\)\);) Tj T*
(         unsuccessful ~ 0.5*\(1 + 1/\(1-alpha\)^2\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Findings) Tj T*
(At alpha=0.9, chaining measured 1.436 successful and 0.912 unsuccessful probes \(theory) Tj T*
(1.450 and 0.900\). Linear probing measured 6.951 and 68.191 \(theory 5.500 and 50.500\).) Tj T*
(Linear probing degrades sharply at high load because primary clustering creates long) Tj T*
(runs of occupied slots. Its unsuccessful-search result deviates most from the uniform-) Tj T*
(hashing estimate. Chaining remains close to its estimates across this run. Finite) Tj T*
(samples and the actual key distribution explain smaller differences from theory.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
